---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Key Features of Soccer100: Best Free Soccer Streams";
const description = "Explore the best features of Soccer100, from match schedules to totalsportek style soccer streams. High-quality free football streaming for all fans.";
const keywords = "soccer100, soccer streams, totalsportek, live football features, match schedules";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none theme-text-primary">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-[#f3a833] mb-8">{title}</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        What makes a site great? For <strong>Soccer100</strong>, it is the fan experience. We use new technology to give you the best <strong>soccer streams</strong> and <strong>totalsportek</strong> style links.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">1. Live Match Schedule</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Staying updated is easy. <strong>Soccer100</strong> has a live schedule so you know when the <strong>soccer streams</strong> and <strong>totalsportek</strong> links are ready.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">2. Many Backup Links</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Our site has many backup links. By providing different <strong>soccer streams</strong>, we make sure you can always watch the game, just like <strong>totalsportek</strong> was famous for.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">3. Works on Any Device</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        We know many fans watch on their phones. <strong>Soccer100</strong> is made to work great on all devices. Our <strong>soccer streams</strong> are fast and look good on any screen.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-10">
        <div class="theme-card p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-lg">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-[#f3a833] mb-2">Fast Access</h4>
          <p class="text-sm">Our design lets you find and start your favorite matches in just a few clicks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-card p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-lg">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-[#f3a833] mb-2">Watch Anywhere</h4>
          <p class="text-sm">Soccer100 lets you watch soccer streams from anywhere in the world for free.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">4. Real-Time Stats</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        We give you more than just video. <strong>Soccer100</strong> has real-time info like scores and team stats. This makes watching our <strong>soccer streams</strong> even better.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Conclusion</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        <strong>Soccer100</strong> is built to give fans the best experience. By focusing on reliability and speed, we have become the trusted home for <strong>soccer streams</strong>. Join us today and see why we are the top choice for fans.
      </p>
    </article>
    
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
      <a href="/blog/" class="text-[#f3a833] font-bold hover:underline">← Back to Blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
